# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF regardless of who commits.
#
# Windows git has core.autocrlf=true by default, so without this a file
# committed from Windows and one committed from CI differ on every line. That
# turns a one-line change into a whole-file diff and makes review useless.
#
# It also matters for test/schema.test.ts, which asserts docs/SCHEMA.sql and
# supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql are byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
